# **Win you and a friend a Day of Drum and Dance!**

[![yenenesh3](/media/2014/03/yenenesh3-1.jpg)](/media/2014/03/yenenesh3-1.jpg) We are offering 3 lucky people a chance to bring a friend and come along for a day of Drum and Dance with Yenenesh Nigusse this March 30th. This prize is worth $100 and all you have to do is have a friend/relative (that isn't already a student of Rhythm Culture) sign up for a $79.00 five week course starting in either March or April.  What do you think? Is there someone you know that may be interested?? March 30th 2014 Drumming workshop 10am-11.30am Dancing workshop 11.30am-1pm. All drumming students are welcome to stay and drum for the dancing! $30 per session (Drum or Dance) or $50 (Drum and Dance). Bookings are essential!
